      "source": "https://www.insightpartners.com/",
      "basis": "The firm's own statement, read off the homepage on 2026-09-27: the title tag reads 'Insight Partners | We Scale Ambition at Every Stage' and the page repeats 'We scale ambition at every stage' as a section heading; set in sentence case with one closing period. Competing lines on the same page: the rotating hero headlines 'Scale Up, Take Off' and 'Scaling the future of AI.', and the meta description 'Insight Partners is a global software investor partnering with high-growth technology, software, and Internet startup and ScaleUp companies.' Published inside quotation marks, as the firm's own words (Erik, 2026-09-26)."
